		{
			"id": "ebuYZ7htzQ6Cwfav8",
			"description": "Force Sword, Astartes Pattern",
			"local_notes": "Lore: The blade of the Astartes Librarian: a Chapter-armoury power sword built to a Marine's grip and reach, with the psychic warding and focus crystals of a force weapon. Librarians of most Chapters favour a sword or staff, in Codex Space Marines background and Black Library Space Marine fiction.\n\nDesign: The human Force Sword's damage formula unchanged (sw+3d+1(10) field on, sw+1 field off), for the same reason the Astartes Power Sword is: \"sw\" resolves from the wielder's own ST, so a Marine (ST 30, sw 5d+2) rolls far more dice than a human without the weapon's line changing. Field-on is 8d+3(10), average 31, which penetrates Astartes plate always and Terminator plate (eff. DR 20) 98.6% of the time. Handling: the same heavier housing as the Astartes Power Sword: 9 lb and min ST 16, out of an unaugmented human's reach. Parry 0 (Broadsword). Cost $500 above the human pattern, as the Astartes Power Sword is above the human one.",
			"tags": [
				"Melee Weapon",
				"Imperium",
				"Psyker",
				"Adeptus Astartes"
			],
