		{
			"id": "e5EDY0dwSW1DSXuPl",
			"description": "Force Axe",
			"local_notes": "Human-scale pattern; see the Astartes pattern below.\n\nLore: A heavier disruption weapon, favoured by psykers who fight as heavily as they cast — some Ordo Malleus interrogators in Black Library material, and offered as a standard force-weapon option in Dark Heresy/Rogue Trader.\n\nDesign: Scaled up from the Force Sword the same way the framework scales chainaxes from chainswords: heavier mundane baseline (sw+2 cut), the same power-field math (+3d over the mundane weapon, armour divisor (10)), and a parry penalty for the unbalanced swing. Handling: 6 lb and min ST 12 match the human Power Axe. Parry 0U, the Basic Set Axe/Mace figure applied to every one-handed axe in this project (Power Axe and Chainaxe carry the same).",
			"tags": [
				"Melee Weapon",
